# --- Wound tissue segmentation (DFUTissue dataset) ---
# The DFUTissue data was granted for nonprofit academic use with NO
# REDISTRIBUTION (Prof. Zeyun Yu, 2026-09-04 — see docs/permissions/).
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC, so the rule below denies everything under tissue/
# by default and allows only source code and notes back in. A new image, mask
# or checkpoint therefore cannot be committed by accident.
tissue/**
!tissue/**/
!tissue/**/*.py
!tissue/**/*.md
!tissue/configs/*.json
!tissue/results/*.json
!tissue/requirements.txt

# A clone of the upstream dataset repo, wherever it lands
DFUTissueSegNet/

# Trained weights and the training virtualenv — never commit either
tissue-venv/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

